Package: uc-chassis-robot
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Yojan Gautam <gautamyojan0@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), python3-serial
Description: uc-chassis tank-drive robot controller
 Modular Python stack that drives a tank-drive ground robot on a Raspberry Pi
 with a SunFounder Fusion HAT, commanded over an XBee radio from a base station.
 .
 Installs the application to /opt/uc-chassis and runs it as the
 uc-chassis-robot systemd service (started on boot). Per-robot settings live in
 /etc/uc-chassis/robot.env.
 .
 Note: the SunFounder "fusion_hat" Python library is not packaged here and must
 be installed separately per SunFounder's docs; without it the motor layer
 falls back to a no-op mock.
